    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάξ</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a
				row,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				380
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντόμως</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1296
			</span></i> ; <i>forthwith, straightway,</i> cj. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				292.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>by command</i> or <i>pre-arrangement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.</u>
				1.1.9
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.239
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπάξ.</span>)</div>
